    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are delighted to present to the market 127 Leighlin Road. An attractive 2 bedroom home, extended to rear and boasting a spacious, sunny garden to the rear and side with off street parking to the front. Situated in this ever-popular road, overlooking the green and within walking distance to every amenity imaginable including Kimmage Village and Eamonn Ceannt Park on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hallway. There is a very spacious living room with solid wood flooring throughout, understairs storage off and pocket sliding door leading through to the extension to the rear. The kitchen/dining room has been built with light in mind with large bifold doors overlooking the garden, apex window, rooflight and window to the side. The kitchen itself has a wide range of kitchen units, island unit with additional storage, 1 1/3 sink unit, recessed lights and a tiled floor throughout. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, Bedroom 1 is to the front with laminate floor and built in wardrobes. Bedroom 2 is to the rear with laminate floor. There is a shower room off the landing with shower, whb, w.c and hot press. \r\n\r\nOutside are low maintenance gardens to the front and rear. There is off street parking for a number of cars to the front, wide side garden and spacious gardens to the rear laid out in lawn and paved patio area. \r\n\r\nLeighlin Road highly sought after location with all the amenities of Kimmage, Harold’s Cross and Crumlin close by. Both Sundrive shopping centre and the Ashleaf shopping centre within a few minutes offering a superb range of shops, cafes and bars. There is a wide selection of both primary & secondary schools to choose from in the area.\r\n\r\nRecreational facilities are plentiful in the area, with Eamonn Ceannt Park, Stannaway Park and Mount Argus Park all within easy walking distance. This is a highly convenient location in terms of quick and easy access to the city centre with numerous local bus routes linking into the city and further afield.  The M50 linking to the national road network is also closeby. \r\n\r\nThis is an immaculate property in a highly accessible and popular residential location, viewing is recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nSolid wood floors. \r\n\r\nLiving \r\nSolid wood floors, understairs storage, pocket sliding door. \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining  \r\nTiled floor throughout, bifold doors, apex window, rooflight and window to side. \r\nKitchen is complete with an extensive range of units, 1 1/3 stainless steel sink unit, integrated appliances, island unit with breakfast bar seating. \r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1 (Front)\r\nLaminate floor, built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Rear) \r\n Laminate floor \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nTiled floor, part tiled walls, shower, w.c, whb and hot press. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nOff street parking to the front for a number of cars, side access and wide side garden. Sunny garden to the rear laid out in paved patio area and lawn."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Extended to rear \r\nSide access and wide garden \r\nOff street parking \r\nSpacious garden to rear \r\nWell proportioned accommodation \r\nExcellent condition throughout\r\nOverlooking green to the front\r\nGreat transport links into the city centre\r\nBeside Kimmage, Crumlin and Harold’s Cross\r\nNumerous bus routes in the area\r\nBeside several green open spaces and parks \r\nConvenient to the M50"
      },
